#. settings-schema.json->credentials-label->description
msgid ""
"This applet reads live scores from the Live Tennis API, a third-party "
"service. A free key (no card) is issued at livetennisapi.com and is enough "
"for everything this applet does. Until a key is entered the applet makes no "
"network requests at all."
msgstr ""

#. settings-schema.json->api-key->description
msgid "API key"
msgstr ""

#. settings-schema.json->api-key->tooltip
msgid ""
"Paste the key from your Live Tennis API account. It is sent only to "
"api.livetennisapi.com, in a request header, and is never written to the "
"Cinnamon log."
msgstr ""

#. settings-schema.json->cadence-label->description
msgid ""
"A free key allows 100 requests a day. This applet spends one request per "
"update, so 15 minutes (96 a day) is the fastest cadence a free key can "
"sustain for a whole day. Shorter intervals are not offered, and the applet "
"enforces the 15-minute floor itself."
msgstr ""

